<urn:atm:triage:finding/AX5-QA2-008>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AX5-QA2-008" ;
  triage:title "apply_task_completion relies on .expect() for a cross-module invariant enforced only by admit() in atm-storage" ;
  triage:description "AX.5 QA-2 (quality-mgr ax5-qa-r2, PR #1201 Final Quality Report 2026-09-05T14:22Z) at head fbee74ba8a9abf0b3e04b01bc157b8a65f194119. rust-best-practices reviewer note carried by quality-mgr (AX5-QA2-N06): crates/atm-storage-rusqlite/src/writer/task_ops.rs:343 in apply_task_completion uses .expect() on a value whose validity is guaranteed only by admit() in atm-storage, an invariant not locally enforceable in this crate. Pre-existing (AX.3 commit 95f05b3f7, entered the PR via merge c5c7f1a5b); filed per the no-dismissal rule at minor severity. Fix: map the failure to an AtmError instead of panicking, or document and assert the invariant at the admit boundary." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ax" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "RBP" ;
